    ============================================================================
    Chronicle.Domain — the innermost layer.

    This project MUST have zero <PackageReference> and zero <ProjectReference>
    elements. It is entities and enums over the BCL, nothing else.

    Chronicle.Domain.Tests enforces this by parsing this file, so the boundary
    cannot rot silently. If you find yourself wanting to add a package here,
    the thing you are modelling belongs in Chronicle.Application instead.

    Shared properties (net10.0, nullable, implicit usings) come from
    Directory.Build.props at the repository root.
    ============================================================================
  -->

</Project>
